flowchart TD
    A[Workflow Start<br/>POST execute] --> A1[synthesis_log: workflow_start]
    A1 --> B[Auto Orchestration<br/>auto_orchestration.py<br/>output_key / retry / quality_gate / judge 自動推論]

    B --> C[Explore Step<br/>agent_profile=explore<br/>色: 青]
    C --> C1[bundle 生成<br/>AgentProfile Prompt + Memory + Skill Prompt]
    C1 --> C2[local_worker 実行<br/>read-only 制約]
    C2 --> C3[completion_service<br/>結果保存 + メモリ更新]
    C3 --> C4[blackboard: explore_result<br/>output_key 自動生成]
    C4 --> C5[synthesis_log: step_complete]
    C5 --> D[Plan Step<br/>agent_profile=plan<br/>色: 橙]

    D --> D1[bundle 生成 + Memory 注入]
    D1 --> D2[local_worker 実行<br/>read-only 制約]
    D2 --> D3[completion_service + メモリ更新]
    D3 --> D4[blackboard: plan_result]
    D4 --> D5[synthesis_log: step_complete]
    D5 --> E[Implement Step<br/>agent_profile=implement<br/>色: 緑]

    E --> E0{execution_kind?}
    E0 -->|http_provider| E1[bundle 生成 + Memory 注入]
    E0 -->|external_cli| E_CLI[External CLI Runtime<br/>Claude Code / Codex / Generic]
    E_CLI --> E_APR{approval_policy?}
    E_APR -->|ask_before_shell| E_WAIT[Session: waiting_approval<br/>approval.requested event]
    E_WAIT --> E_MODAL[User Modal<br/>approve / reject]
    E_MODAL -->|approve| E_GRANT[approval.granted<br/>Session: running]
    E_MODAL -->|reject| E_REJECT[approval.rejected<br/>step.failed]
    E_APR -->|allow_shell| E_GRANT
    E_GRANT --> E_SPAWN[CLI spawn + streaming<br/>workspace temp_dir]
    E_SPAWN --> E3
    E1 --> E2[local_worker 実行]
    E2 --> E3[completion_service + メモリ更新<br/>+ session events: step.completed<br/>+ runtime.selected + artifact.created]
    E3 --> E4[blackboard: implement_result]
    E4 --> E5[synthesis_log: step_complete]
    E5 --> F[Verification Step<br/>agent_profile=verification<br/>色: 桃]

    F --> F1[bundle 生成<br/>証跡フォーマット + Adversarial Probe 必須]
    F1 --> F2[local_worker 実行<br/>break-it mindset]
    F2 --> F3[品質ゲート<br/>regex: VERDICT 行チェック]
    F3 -->|PASS| F4[verdict 正規化 → final_verdict 保存]
    F3 -->|FAIL| F3R[Reflection: critique 付き再実行<br/>_nexmagi_continuation メタデータ]
    F3R --> F1
    F4 --> F5[synthesis_log: step_complete + group_complete]
    F5 --> G[synthesis_log: leader_start]

    G --> L[Leader 統合<br/>agent_profile=default<br/>色: 紫<br/>プロンプト自動生成]
    L --> L1[all_step_results + blackboard 統合]
    L1 --> L2[synthesis_log: leader_complete]
    L2 --> H[Workflow Complete<br/>coordinator_view: completed]

    subgraph Coordinator View
        CV1[current_stage<br/>リアルタイム更新]
        CV2[latest_summary + why<br/>判断理由付き]
        CV3[synthesis_events<br/>DB保存タイムライン]
        CV4[final_verdict<br/>PASS / FAIL / PARTIAL]
    end

    subgraph Session Layer
        SL1[session_status<br/>initializing → running → completed]
        SL2[runtime_bindings<br/>step → adapter/runtime/kind]
        SL3[workspace_bindings<br/>step → workspace_id/mode/path]
        SL4[approval_summary<br/>pending / granted / rejected]
        SL5[normalized events<br/>event_seq + event_namespace]
    end

    subgraph Persistent Memory
        PM1[workflow_memories<br/>workflow × profile]
        PM2[starter_seed<br/>初回のみ適用]
    end

    C --> CV1
    D --> CV1
    E --> CV1
    F --> CV1
    L --> CV1

    C5 --> CV3
    D5 --> CV3
    E5 --> CV3
    F5 --> CV3
    L2 --> CV3

    F4 --> CV4

    C3 --> PM1
    D3 --> PM1
    E3 --> PM1

    A1 --> SL1
    C3 --> SL2
    D3 --> SL2
    E3 --> SL2
    E_SPAWN --> SL3
    E_WAIT --> SL4
    E_GRANT --> SL4
    C5 --> SL5
    D5 --> SL5
    E5 --> SL5
    F5 --> SL5
    L2 --> SL5
